FlashQLA source attribution
===========================

The device kernels in flashqla_gdn.cu are derived from FlashQLA 0.1.2,
released under the MIT License.  The vendored TileLang CUDA templates are
from TileLang 0.1.9 and the vendored CUTLASS/CuTe headers are distributed
under their respective Apache-2.0/BSD-3-Clause notices.  These files are
used only as compile-time device source; Atlas does not link TileLang, TVM,
or any Python runtime when loading this kernel module.

The complete upstream notices are retained in the vendored header trees.
